#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "You do not have permission for the device of that cluster."
msgstr "Uma lihid ogolaansho aaladda kooxdaas (cluster)."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Name: another cluster already uses this name."
msgstr "Magaca: koox kale (cluster) ayaa horay u isticmaashay magacan."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not saved: it was changed by someone else since the form was opened, or the write failed. Open it again and repeat the change."
msgstr "Kooxda (cluster) lama keydin: waxaa beddelay qof kale tan iyo markii foomka la furay, ama qoristu way fashilantay. Mar kale fur oo ku celi isbeddelka."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was saved."
msgstr "Kooxda (cluster) waa la keydiyay."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster state was not changed: the write failed. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Xaaladda kooxda (cluster) lama beddelin: qoristu way fashilantay. Eeg diiwaanka Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster and its cached snapshot were deleted. Its device and graphs were kept. The scheduler was not contacted."
msgstr "Kooxda (cluster) iyo sawirkeeda kaydsan (snapshot) waa la tirtiray. Aaladdeeda iyo garaafyadeeda waa la hayay. Jadwal-sameeyaha lama xiriirin."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device and its graphs were created."
msgstr "Aaladda iyo garaafyadeeda waa la abuuray."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device was not created: the cluster already has a device, it was changed by someone else since the page was opened, or Cacti refused it. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Aaladda lama abuurin: kooxda (cluster) horay ayay u leedahay aalad, waxaa beddelay qof kale tan iyo markii bogga la furay, ama Cacti ayaa diiday. Eeg diiwaanka Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was mapped to the device."
msgstr "Kooxda (cluster) waxaa lagu xiray aaladda."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not mapped: the device does not exist, is not allowed to you, already carries another cluster, or the cluster was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Kooxda (cluster) laguma xirin: aaladda ma jirto, laguma oggola adiga, horay ayay u siddaa koox kale, ama kooxda waxaa beddelay qof kale tan iyo markii bogga la furay."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Missing graphs were added."
msgstr "Garaafyadii maqnaa waa lagu daray."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "No graphs were added: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Wax garaafyo ah laguma darin: kooxdu (cluster) ma laha aalad, ama aaladdeeda hadda ma jirto."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not unmapped: it was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Kooxda (cluster) lagama furin xiriirka: waxaa beddelay qof kale tan iyo markii bogga la furay."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was unmapped. The device and its graphs were kept."
msgstr "Kooxda (cluster) waa laga furay xiriirka. Aaladda iyo garaafyadeeda waa la hayay."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were reindexed from the snapshot."
msgstr "Qaybaha (partitions) dib ayaa looga tusmeeyay sawirka kaydsan (snapshot)."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the device is disabled or down, so Cacti skipped its data query."
msgstr "Qaybaha (partitions) dib looma tusmeyn: aaladda waa la naafiyay ama lama gaari karo, sidaas darteed Cacti way ka boodday weydiinta xogteeda."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: Cacti could not run the data query. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Qaybaha (partitions) dib looma tusmeyn: Cacti ma wadi karin weydiinta xogta. Eeg diiwaanka Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the HPC Scheduler data query is not installed. Install the templates from the health page."
msgstr "Qaybaha (partitions) dib looma tusmeyn: weydiinta xogta HPC Scheduler lama rakibin. Ka rakib qaab-dhismeedyada bogga caafimaadka."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Qaybaha (partitions) dib looma tusmeyn: kooxdu (cluster) ma laha aalad, ama aaladdeeda hadda ma jirto."

#: hpcsched_health.php
msgid "The HPC Scheduler templates are installed."
msgstr "Qaab-dhismeedyada HPC Scheduler waa la rakibay."

#: hpcsched_health.php
#, php-format
msgid "The templates were not installed: %s"
msgstr "Qaab-dhismeedyada lama rakibin: %s"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Monitoring view"
msgstr "Muuqaalka kormeerka"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Observations could not be read. Ask an administrator to check the plugin log."
msgstr "Kormeerada lama akhrin karin. Weydiiso maamulaha inuu hubiyo diiwaanka plugin-ka."

#: include/operator.php
msgid "Inspect pending reason families and snapshot freshness on the overview. Escalate credentials, cluster mappings and maintenance policy to an administrator."
msgstr "Baar qaybaha sababaha sugitaanka iyo cusboonaanta sawirka kaydsan (snapshot) ee guudmarka. U gudbi aqoonsiyada, xiriirrada kooxaha iyo siyaasadda dayactirka maamulaha."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Name: use 1 to 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, starting with a letter or digit."
msgstr "Magaca: isticmaal 1 ilaa 64 xaraf, lambar, dhibic, jiitin, ama xariiq hoose, adigoo ku bilaabaya xaraf ama lambar."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Poller: choose one of the listed pollers."
msgstr "Poller: ka dooro mid ka mid ah poller-rada liiska ku jira."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Collection Interval: enter whole seconds from %d to %d."
msgstr "Muddada Ururinta: geli ilbiriqsiyo dhan laga bilaabo %d ilaa %d."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Transport: choose one of the listed transports."
msgstr "Gaadiidka (Transport): ka dooro mid ka mid ah gaadiidyada liiska ku jira."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurm.conf: enter an absolute path, or leave it empty to use the poller default."
msgstr "slurm.conf: geli jid dhammaystiran, ama u daa bannaanka si loo isticmaalo ka-hormarinta poller-ka."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: this host and port are not on the slurmrestd host list in Settings."
msgstr "slurmrestd URL: martigeliyahan iyo dekeddan (port) kuma jiraan liiska martigeliyaha slurmrestd ee ku jira Dejinta."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: enter an https:// URL without user name, query, or fragment; plain http:// is accepted only for a loopback address."
msgstr "slurmrestd URL: geli https:// URL aan lahayn magac isticmaale, weydiin, ama qayb; http:// caadi ah waxaa la aqbalaa oo keliya ciwaanka loopback."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd User: use at most 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, or leave it empty for a user token."
msgstr "Isticmaalaha slurmrestd: isticmaal ugu badnaan 64 xaraf, lambar, dhibic, jiitin, ama xariiq hoose, ama u daa bannaanka calaamadda isticmaalaha (token)."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: enter the absolute path of the token file on the poller. The token itself is never entered here."
msgstr "Faylka Token: geli jidka dhammaystiran ee faylka token-ka ee ku yaal poller-ka. Token-ka laftiisa marnaba halkan lagama geliyo."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: no token file directories are set yet. Ask a Cacti administrator to set them under Settings, HPC Scheduler."
msgstr "Faylka Token: weli lama dejin wax galka faylka token ah. Weydiiso maamulaha Cacti inuu ku dejiyo Dejinta, HPC Scheduler."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Token File: the file must be inside one of the token file directories set in Settings (%s)."
msgstr "Faylka Token: faylku waa inuu ku jiraa mid ka mid ah galka faylasha token-ka ee lagu dejiyay Dejinta (%s)."

