#: lib/ClustersPage.php
msgid "Client commands use the binaries set under Settings > HPC Scheduler and the poller user's own Slurm authentication; the optional slurm.conf path selects a cluster. slurmrestd fields are used only with that transport. The token file must be readable by the poller user only; the plugin reads it at each run and never stores the token."
msgstr "Awaamiirta macmiilka waxay isticmaalaan faylasha fulinta ee lagu dejiyay Dejinta > HPC Scheduler iyo xaqiijinta Slurm ee isticmaalaha poller-ka; jidka ikhtiyaariga ah ee slurm.conf wuxuu doortaa koox. Meelaha slurmrestd waxaa loo isticmaalaa oo keliya gaadiidkaas. Faylka token waa inuu u akhrisan karaa oo keliya isticmaalaha poller-ka; barnaamij-ku-darku wuxuu akhriyaa orod kasta mana keydiyo token-ka marnaba."

