#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Maximum Answer Size is %d MiB, but a decoded answer of that size does not fit in the Collection Memory of %d MiB; the reader allows %d MiB. Raise Collection Memory or lower Maximum Answer Size in Settings."
msgstr "Cabirka Ugu Badan ee Jawaabta waa %d MiB, laakiin jawaab furfuran oo cabbirkaas ah kuma habboona Xasuusta Ururinta ee %d MiB; akhriyuhu wuxuu oggol yahay %d MiB. Kordhi Xasuusta Ururinta ama hoos u dhig Cabirka Ugu Badan ee Jawaabta ee Dejinta."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Assigned to poller %d, a remote data collector. This release collects only on the main poller, so the cluster is not collected; remote collection is planned for phase 3. Assign it to the main poller."
msgstr "Waxaa loo xilsaaray poller %d, oo ah ururiyaha xogta fog. Soo-saarkani wuxuu wax ka ururiyaa poller-ka weyn oo keliya, sidaas darteed kooxda lama ururiyo; ururinta fog waxaa loo qorsheeyay wejiga 3. U xilsaar poller-ka weyn."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The collection interval is below the %d second floor."
msgstr "Muddada ururintu waxay ka hooseysaa xadka hoose ee %d ilbiriqsi."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The collection interval of %d seconds is shorter than the poller interval of %d seconds; data is collected every %d seconds."
msgstr "Muddada ururinta ee %d ilbiriqsi way ka gaaban tahay muddada poller-ka ee %d ilbiriqsi; xogta waxaa la ururiyaa %d ilbiriqsi kasta."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
msgid "slurmrestd is reached over plain HTTP on the loopback address; the token crosses the local network stack unencrypted."
msgstr "slurmrestd waxaa lagu gaaraa HTTP caadi ah oo ku yaal ciwaanka loopback; token-ku wuxuu dhex maraa shabakadda maxalliga ah isagoo aan la qarin."

