#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Data Parser"
msgstr "Falanqeeyaha Xogta"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Slurm data parser for the client commands. Choose one that the release of every cluster read through client commands ships: v0.0.43 is in 25.05, 25.11, and 26.05 and is removed in 27.05; v0.0.44 needs 25.11 or later; v0.0.45 needs 26.05 or later. The health page warns when a cluster reports a release without it. Clusters read through slurmrestd ignore this setting: they use the newest of these the daemon serves, and the health page shows which."
msgstr "Falanqeeyaha xogta Slurm ee amarada macaamiisha. Dooro mid ay keento sii-deynta koox kasta oo lagu akhriyo amarada macaamiisha: v0.0.43 waxay ku jirtaa 25.05, 25.11, iyo 26.05 waxaana laga saaray 27.05; v0.0.44 waxay u baahan tahay 25.11 ama wixii ka dambeeya; v0.0.45 waxay u baahan tahay 26.05 ama wixii ka dambeeya. Bogga caafimaadku wuu digayaa marka kooxdu soo sheegto sii-deyn la'aantiis. Kooxaha lagu akhriyo slurmrestd way iska indhatiraan dejintan: waxay isticmaalaan kuwa ugu cusub ee daemon-ku bixiyo, bogga caafimaadkuna wuxuu muujinayaa midkaas."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to squeue on each poller that reads a cluster through client commands. The plugin runs it only as squeue --all --json with the data parser above."
msgstr "Dariiq buuxa oo loo maro squeue oo ku yaalla cod-bixiye kasta oo koox ku akhriya amarada macaamiisha. Ku-darku wuxuu u socodsiiyaa oo keliya sida squeue --all --json isagoo adeegsanaya falanqeeyaha xogta ee sare."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "squeue"
msgstr "squeue"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to scontrol. The plugin runs only scontrol --json show node, show partition, and show reservation; never update, reconfigure, or token."
msgstr "Dariiq buuxa oo loo maro scontrol. Ku-darku wuxuu socodsiiyaa oo keliya scontrol --json show node, show partition, iyo show reservation; marnaba ma socodsiiyo update, reconfigure, ama token."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "scontrol"
msgstr "scontrol"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to sshare, used only for clusters that collect fair-share."
msgstr "Dariiq buuxa oo loo maro sshare, waxaa loo isticmaalaa oo keliya kooxaha ururiya qaybsi caddaalad ah."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "sshare"
msgstr "sshare"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "Xadka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Call Timeout"
msgstr "Dhammaadka Waqtiga Wicitaanka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one scheduler call may take before it is stopped and its section recorded as failed. A call never runs past the reader time budget either."
msgstr "Ilbiriqsiyada uu qaadan karo hal wicitaan oo qorsheeye ka hor inta aan la joojin oo qaybtiisa loo diiwaangelin inay fashilantay. Wicitaanku marnaba kama gudbo miisaaniyadda waqtiga akhriyaha."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Answer Size"
msgstr "Cabbirka Ugu Badan ee Jawaabta"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB one scheduler call may return. A larger answer is discarded and its section recorded as failed. Decoding needs about 12 times the answer size, so the reader uses at most (Collection Memory - 64) / 12 MiB and the health page warns when this value is larger."
msgstr "MiB ee uu hal wicitaan oo qorsheeye soo celin karo. Jawaab ka weyn waa la tuuraa qaybteedana waxaa loo diiwaangeliyaa inay fashilantay. Furfuridda xogtu waxay u baahan tahay qiyaastii 12 jeer cabbirka jawaabta, sidaas darteed akhriyuhu wuxuu isticmaalaa ugu badnaan (Xusuusta Ururinta - 64) / 12 MiB bogga caafimaadkuna wuu digayaa marka qiimahani ka weyn yahay."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection Memory"
msgstr "Xusuusta Ururinta"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB of PHP memory each collection run raises its limit to (it never lowers one). The default of 1024 fits answers up to 80 MiB."
msgstr "MiB ee xusuusta PHP oo orod kasta oo ururin ah uu kor ugu qaado xadkiisa (marnaba hoos uma dhigo). Qiimaha caadiga ah ee 1024 wuxuu qaadaa jawaabo ilaa 80 MiB."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to prlimit (util-linux), used to cap the address space of each client command. Leave empty to run commands without a memory limit; the health page then warns."
msgstr "Dariiq buuxa oo loo maro prlimit (util-linux), oo loo isticmaalo in lagu xaddido booska cinwaanka ee amar kasta oo macmiil ah. Banaan ku dhaaf si amarada loo socodsiiyo xad xusuus la'aan; bogga caafimaadku markaas wuu digayaa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "prlimit"
msgstr "prlimit"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Command Memory Limit"
msgstr "Xadka Xusuusta Amarka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB of address space each client command may use, through prlimit."
msgstr "MiB ee booska cinwaanka oo amar kasta oo macmiil ah uu isticmaali karo, iyada oo loo marayo prlimit."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "slurmrestd Credentials"
msgstr "Aqoonsiga slurmrestd"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Token File Directories"
msgstr "Hagayaasha Faylasha Calaamadaha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute directories on the pollers that may hold slurmrestd token files, separated by commas or spaces. A cluster can name only a token file inside one of them, owned by the poller user and reached without a symbolic link. Keep each directory writable only by root and the poller user. Empty means no cluster can use slurmrestd."
msgstr "Hagayaal buuxa oo ku yaalla cod-bixiyayaasha oo hayn kara faylasha calaamadaha slurmrestd, oo lagu kala saaray hakadyo ama bannaanyo. Kooxdu waxay magacaabi kartaa oo keliya fayl calaamad oo ku dhex jira mid iyaga ka mid ah, uu leeyahay isticmaalaha cod-bixiyuhu, oo la gaaro iyada oo aan lahayn isku-xir calaamad (symbolic link). Ka dhig hage kasta mid ay qori karaan oo keliya root iyo isticmaalaha cod-bixiyaha. Maran micnaheedu waa kooxna ma isticmaali karto slurmrestd."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "slurmrestd Hosts"
msgstr "Martigeliyayaasha slurmrestd"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional. The slurmrestd hosts a cluster may name, as host or host:port, separated by commas or spaces. An entry without a port allows any port on that host. Empty allows any host."
msgstr "Ikhtiyaari. Martigeliyayaasha slurmrestd ee ay kooxdu magacaabi karto, sida host ama host:port, oo lagu kala saaray hakadyo ama bannaanyo. Gelitaanka aan lahayn deked wuxuu ogolaanayaa deked kasta oo martigeliyahaas ah. Maran wuxuu ogolaanayaa martigeliye kasta."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds before a token expires when the health page starts to warn, if the token carries an expiry time."
msgstr "Ilbiriqsiyada ka hor inta aysan calaamaddu dhicin marka bogga caafimaadku bilaabo inuu digo, haddii calaamaddu sidato waqti dhicis."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Token Expiry Warning"
msgstr "Digniinta Dhicista Calaamadda"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Ka saar"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Ilaali Jadwalka Plugin-ka Marka La Saarayo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its clusters and snapshots. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the clusters first from HPC Clusters. The plugin creates no Cacti devices or Maint schedules in this release, and the scheduler is never contacted either way."
msgstr "Marka la calaamadiyo, ka-saarista ku-darku waxay haysaa kooxihiisa iyo sawir-qaadisyadiisa. Nadiifi si ka-saaristu u tirtirto iyaga; marka hore ka dhoofi kooxaha HPC Clusters. Ku-darku ma abuuro qalab Cacti ama jadwal Maint ah sii-deyntan, qorsheeyahana marnaba lama la xiriiro labada dhinacba."

#: lib/TemplateInstaller.php
#, php-format
msgid "The data query file %s is not installed in Cacti's resource/script_server directory."
msgstr "Faylka weydiinta xogta %s kuma rakibna hagaha resource/script_server ee Cacti."

#: lib/TemplateInstaller.php
