#: lib/TokenState.php
msgid "refused: owned by a user other than the poller user (chown it to the poller user)"
msgstr "la diiday: waxaa leh isticmaale aan ahayn isticmaalaha cod-bixiyaha (ugu wareeji chown isticmaalaha cod-bixiyaha)"

#: lib/TokenState.php
