msgstr "maqan ama aanu akhrin karin isticmaalaha cod-bixiyuhu"

#: lib/TokenState.php
msgid "refused: outside the token file directories set in Settings, reached through a symbolic link, not a regular file, writable by others, or too large; the log names the reason"
msgstr "la diiday: ka baxsan hagayaasha faylasha calaamadaha ee lagu dejiyay Dejinta, lagu gaaray isku-xir calaamad, ma aha fayl caadi ah, waa u qoran yahay kuwa kale, ama aad buu u weyn yahay; diiwaanku wuxuu magacaabaa sababta"

